{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "momentum_v_duo_g2",
    "description": "Vector-invariant momentum tendency for the covariant v-wind, duo gnomonic cubed-sphere SWE core, Ng=2, WITHOUT the pressure gradient (added by a separate pgrad_*_v rule so both L97 and direct forms are drop-in). Chen (2021) C36/C37 as the Zenodo sw_full: dv/dt = -(u^contra)*sin(alpha)*(f+zeta) + (ke(i)-ke(i+1))/Dy. The absolute vorticity f+zeta is the circulation [dx(vp*Lx)-dy(up*Ly)]/A + f with up,vp the UPWINDED parallel velocities reused from the LMARS solve (Eq 9/C38); the interface kinetic energy is 1/2(u*^2 + up^2) in the local orthogonal frame (Eq 10); (f+zeta) multiplies the contravariant cross-velocity times sin(alpha)=sqrt(g) (C36/C37); Dy is the great-circle arc between the two y-face midpoints. Operates on halo-extended dp,ua,va; f is the problem-supplied Coriolis parameter 2 Omega sin(theta) on [tile,x,y]. Method-of-lines spatial RHS.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:rule",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:duo",
      "op:momentum_v",
      "order:3",
      "bc:duo",
      "axes:tile,x,y",
      "form:vector_invariant"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Chen, X. (2021). The LMARS based shallow-water dynamical core on generic gnomonic cubed-sphere geometry. JAMES 13(1), e2020MS002280.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2020MS002280"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "../stencils/momentum_v_duo_g2_interior.esm"
    }
  ],
